.     * Recode the values
.     replace `var'_temp_num = 5 if `var' == "Extremely dissatisfied"
{txt}  4{com}.     replace `var'_temp_num = 4 if `var' == "Somewhat dissatisfied"
{txt}  5{com}.     replace `var'_temp_num = 3 if `var' == "Neither satisfied nor dissatisfied"
{txt}  6{com}.     replace `var'_temp_num = 2 if `var' == "Somewhat satisfied"
{txt}  7{com}.     replace `var'_temp_num = 1 if `var' == "Extremely satisfied"
