. esttab using "$drive\tabs\Table1aRound1.tex", se keep(hchoice mchoice hmchoice) scalars("hasfe Fixed Effect" "hascon Controls") nomtitles mgroups("Donations (Tokens)", pattern(1 0)   ///
>   prefix(\multicolumn{c -(}@span{c )-}{c -(}c{c )-}{c -(}) suffix({c )-}) span) ///
>        nonotes addnote("OLS regressions of the amount experimental participants donated to charity on two treatment variables: the Options variable measures whether they could see 40 charities versus 5; the Choices variable measures whether they could select multiple charities to donate to versus just one. Individual fixed effects can be included for the Options treatment because there is within-participant variation in the number of charities seen, but the Choices treatment is between-participant. Regressions exclude the default treatment, which measures whether the participant has a pre-selected donation option, and perceived importance treatment which measures whether the participant can see the number of charities devoted to a cause before selecting that cause. Covariates include education level, race, marital status, employment status, religion, income, age, and gender." "Standard errors in parentheses, clustered by individual." "\sym{c -(}*{c )-} \(p<0.10\), \sym{c -(}**{c )-} \(p<0.05\), \sym{c -(}***{c )-} \(p<0.01\)" ) ///
