{com}. 
. esttab using "$drive\tabs\Table4.tex", se keep(LHHH HLLL LLLL)  scalars("hascon Controls") nomtitles mgroups("Hypothesis 4", pattern(1) ///
>   prefix(\multicolumn{c -(}@span{c )-}{c -(}c{c )-}{c -(}) suffix({c )-}) span) ///
>        nonotes addnote("OLS regressions of a dummy measuring whether or not experimental participants donated to an animal welfare charity on three treatment dummies. In the base category, animal welfare and the other three charitable causes (children and young people; housing and hunger; health and medicine) all have 40 charities devoted to them. In the LHHH treatment, animal welfare has 5 charities and the others all have 40. In the HLLL treatment, animal welfare has 40 charities and the others all have 5. In the LLLL treatment, all causes have 5 charities devote devoted to them. Covariates include education level, race, marital status, employment status, religion, income, age, and gender." "Standard errors in parentheses, clustered by individual" "\sym{c -(}*{c )-} \(p<0.10\), \sym{c -(}**{c )-} \(p<0.05\), \sym{c -(}***{c )-} \(p<0.01\)") ///
>  alignment(c) label replace ///
>       title (Effect of Number of Charities on Chosen Cause \label{c -(}Table4{c )-})
